{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_09095","headline":"因省风俗与从侄成绪游山水中道先归寄示 · 韦应物","name":"因省风俗与从侄成绪游山水中道先归寄示","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"累宵同燕酌，十舍携征骑。\n始造双林寂，遐搜洞府秘。\n羣峰绕盘郁，悬泉仰特异。\n阴壑云松埋，阳崖烟花媚。\n每虑观省牵，中乖游践志。\n我尚山水行，子归栖息地。\n一操临流袂，上耸干云辔。\n独往倦危途，怀冲寡幽致。\n赖尔还都期，方将登楼迟。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"韦应物","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_09095.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_09095","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"五言古诗","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}